### Pegar Token do Keycloak (Provedor A)

POST http://localhost:8081/realms/betting-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=provider-a&client_secret=super-secret-provider-a&grant_type=client_credentials


### Fazer uma aposta (Provedor A)
POST http://localhost:8080/bet
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <SEU_TOKEN_AQUI>
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:tx-http-004

{
    "wallet_id": "wallet-teste-1791925236121841100",
    "transaction_id": "tx-http-004",
    "amount": "1.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
}

### Criar Nova Carteira
POST http://localhost:8080/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <SEU_TOKEN_AQUI>

{
  "playerId": "jogador-novo-001",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "1000.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}